# Milestone M3 — Participants, Stocks & Picks

This plan implements Participant management, Stock Master catalog (IDX stocks), Tournament Membership, and Daily Stock Picks evaluation inputs according to `tradearena-prd.md` Milestone M3 scope.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> - Backend remains the sole source of truth for business validations: stock picks reject duplicates per `[tournamentId, participantId, tradingDate, stockId]` with HTTP 409 Conflict.
> - Picks require the participant to be an enrolled member of the tournament and the trading date to fall within `[startDate, endDate]`.
> - Initial top liquid IDX stocks (BBCA, BBRI, BMRI, TLKM, ASII, BBNI, GOTO, AMMN, ADRO, BRIS, etc.) will be seeded.

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Backend Modules (`/backend`)

#### [NEW] Stocks Module (`backend/src/stocks`)
- `stocks.service.ts`:
  - List stocks with pagination, search query (symbol/name), and active status filter.
  - Find stock by ID or symbol.
  - Create/update stocks.
- `stocks.controller.ts`:
  - `GET /api/v1/stocks`: List stocks (supports `?search=...&isActive=true`).
  - `GET /api/v1/stocks/:id`: Stock details.
  - `POST /api/v1/stocks`: Protected Admin to add stock.
  - `PUT /api/v1/stocks/:id`: Protected Admin to edit stock.
- `dto/create-stock.dto.ts` & `dto/query-stock.dto.ts`.

#### [NEW] Participants Module (`backend/src/participants`)
- `participants.service.ts`:
  - List participants with search filter.
  - Create, update, get participant by ID.
  - Manage tournament enrollment (`TournamentParticipant`):
    - `enroll(tournamentId, participantId)`
    - `unenroll(tournamentId, participantId)`
    - `getTournamentParticipants(tournamentId)`
- `participants.controller.ts`:
  - `GET /api/v1/participants`: List all participants.
  - `POST /api/v1/participants`: Create participant.
  - `GET /api/v1/participants/:id`: Participant details with pick history.
  - `PUT /api/v1/participants/:id`: Update participant.
  - `GET /api/v1/tournaments/:tournamentId/participants`: List enrolled participants.
  - `POST /api/v1/tournaments/:tournamentId/participants`: Enroll participant.
  - `DELETE /api/v1/tournaments/:tournamentId/participants/:participantId`: Remove participant from tournament.

#### [NEW] Picks Module (`backend/src/picks`)
- `picks.service.ts`:
  - Enforce business validations:
    - Verify tournament exists.
    - Verify participant is enrolled in tournament.
    - Verify stock exists and is active (`isActive = true`).
    - Verify trading date is within tournament `[startDate, endDate]`.
    - Verify positive entry price.
    - Reject duplicates based on `@@unique([tournamentId, participantId, tradingDate, stockId])` with a clear 409 Conflict.
  - Query picks with filters: `tournamentId`, `tradingDate`, `participantId`, `stockId`.
  - Update and delete pick.
- `picks.controller.ts`:
  - `GET /api/v1/tournaments/:tournamentId/picks`: List picks for a tournament (filterable by date & participant).
  - `POST /api/v1/tournaments/:tournamentId/picks`: Create stock pick.
  - `GET /api/v1/picks/:id`: Pick details.
  - `PUT /api/v1/picks/:id`: Update pick (entry price, source, timestamp).
  - `DELETE /api/v1/picks/:id`: Delete pick.

#### [MODIFY] `backend/src/app.module.ts`
- Register `StocksModule`, `ParticipantsModule`, and `PicksModule`.

#### [MODIFY] `backend/prisma/seed.ts`
- Add initial liquid IDX stocks (BBCA, BBRI, BMRI, TLKM, ASII, BBNI, GOTO, AMMN, ADRO, BRIS, KLBF, ICBP, PGAS, UNTR) and demo participants.

